GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TanyaTeam> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TanyaTeam> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Actor_TanyaTeam> ;
    narr:childCount "132"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """This hub is Tanya's voice across two fundraising-season calls. The product thesis runs from [the graph of ingested human decisions as the moat](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_110) through [governance meetings as the real source of truth](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_78), [the transcript-to-perspective read pattern](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_80), [an append-only, zero-retention architecture](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_84), and [witnessing statements without pre-resolving meaning](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_92). Commercially she lays out [the team and enterprise pricing ladder and asks for feedback on it](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_100), states [the 500k bridge raise toward a seed](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102), and asks [for introductions to funders and customers](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_170). Mid-first-call she drops into [admitting the front-end story has gotten less clear than the vision once was](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_140) and [naming her pitch as having regressed in crispness](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_152). The second call reframes: [a B2C-first reading of the product with a B2B top tier](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_5), [repositioning the enterprise plan around deployment shape rather than company size](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_21), [a podcast-built marketplace of installable expertise](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_24), and [AI perspective as a deck alternative for consulting clients](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_26). She closes both calls on [pulling her head out of development to go sell](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_29).""" ;
